 t('<b>Genesis</b>', 'industrial revolution, trusts, tariffs', 'new needs with technology and agriculture', 'welfare state: more state power to influence', 'dominant want help to grow; weak want basic needs', '<b>freedom of association</b>', 'gaps in political parties\' articulation', w=24),
