 OWN('CARSE', 'Audit-on: <b>C</b>onsolidated and other funds · <b>A</b>ccounts (trading, P&amp;L) · <b>R</b>eceipts · <b>S</b>tores · <b>E</b>ntities financed (bodies, PSUs).'),
